      "side": 1,
      "message": "I like that! updated to dependsOnPaintersOrder\n\nI\u0027m not renaming clip.fOrder for now just because I have a follow-up CL that actual changes the return type. The scissor and draw bounds move to a type shared by DrawList and the order is returned as part of a pair, so \u0027fOrder\u0027 goes away entirely.",
